        "original_id": "c4e8cef2-53e9-55ec-9fbc-f30aae5b69bb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Elena Shaddow, Adam Guettel, Katie Clarke, Richard Rodgers\n- Works: The Light in the Piazza\n- Roles: Clara Johnson\n- Awards: Tony Awards, Drama Desk Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Adam Guettel was born on December 16, 1964.\n- Adam Guettel is an American composer-lyricist of musical theater and opera.\n- Richard Rodgers was Adam Guettel's grandfather.\n- Adam Guettel is best known for the musical The Light in the Piazza.\n- Adam Guettel won two Tony Awards for The Light in the Piazza, for Best Score and Best Orchestrations.\n- Adam Guettel won two Drama Desk Awards for The Light in the Piazza, for Best Music and Best Orchestrations.\n- Elena Shaddow recently toured as Clara Johnson in Adam Guettel's The Light in the Piazza before leaving the production.\n- Katie Clarke replaced Elena Shaddow in the touring production of The Light in the Piazza.",
